{
  "id": "cross_product_root_fraction",
  "root_variable": "z",
  "substitutions": {
    "lam": "lambda",
    "A": "X_00(z,lambda*z)",
    "B": "X_11(z,lambda*z)",
    "C": "X_02(z,lambda*z)",
    "Q": "X_01(z,z)"
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "0 < lam",
    "Q != 0",
    "C = -A",
    "lam*A*B = Q^2",
    "0 < Q^2-lam^2*A^2"
  ],
  "steps": [
    "次数2の漸化式と根条件より C=-A。",
    "交差積の行列式とWronskianより lam*A*B=Q^2、Q=-2/(pi*z)。",
    "u(t)=X_00(z,t) のBessel方程式を積分すると Q^2-lam^2*A^2=(2/z^2)*integral(lam*z,z,t*u(t)^2) > 0。",
    "分母を lam*A*(B-lam*A) に因数分解し、非零性を用いて約分する。"
  ],
  "sources": [
    "https://dlmf.nist.gov/10.6.E1",
    "https://dlmf.nist.gov/10.6.E10",
    "https://dlmf.nist.gov/10.5.E2",
    "https://dlmf.nist.gov/10.2.E1"
  ],
  "formal_obligations": [
    "Bessel Y and X definitions",
    "root recurrence",
    "Wronskian scaling",
    "positive energy integral"
  ]
}
